invariant: INV-17
file: pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_test
reason: ch_p256_key_from_pem returns with the scalar's working copy on
  its own stack. pem_files.h promises every copy the call makes is wiped
  on every path; test_key_wipes searches the stack below the call for
  eight bytes of the scalar, in either byte order, and finds them.

--- old
    ct_wipe(der, sizeof der);
    ct_wipe(scalar, sizeof scalar);
--- new
    ct_wipe(der, sizeof der);
